				type: Response
				trigger: {
					type: aboutToDiscard
					filter: another,condition,or(culture(gundabad),culture(mirkwood))
					opponent: true
				}
				cost: {
					type: discard
					select: self
				}
				effect: {
					type: preventDiscard
					select: all(any)
				}
			}
		]
		gametext: When you play this condition, you may play a [mirkwood] condition from your draw deck or discard pile.<br><b>Response:</b> If [gundabad] and/or [mirkwood] conditions are about to be discarded by an opponent, discard this condition to prevent that.
